# The library's own strings.
#
# The file name is part of every key: I18nModule.getPrefix builds them as `<file>.<key>`, so a
# line here is asked for as `hytechcore.items.X.name`. It cannot be called server.lang like the
# content mod's -- an asset is keyed by its file name, so the two would collide and the pack that
# loaded last would shadow the other outright.
items.Tool_Wrench.name=Wrench
items.Tool_Wrench.description=Cycles the input/output configuration of a block or pipe face.
items.Multimeter.name=Multimeter
items.Multimeter.description=Reports what every logistic container on the block you point at is holding.
ui.itemcategory.technic.general=General
ui.itemcategory.technic.machines=Machines
ui.itemcategory.technic.materials=Materials
ui.itemcategory.technic.components=Components

# Debug pipes: the reference pipe a content mod copies, at a throughput high enough that
# it never becomes the bottleneck you are trying to watch.
items.Pipe_Debug_Energy.name=Debug Energy Pipe
items.Pipe_Debug_Energy.description=Unlimited energy throughput, for testing. Creative only.
items.Pipe_Debug_Items.name=Debug Item Pipe
items.Pipe_Debug_Items.description=Unlimited item throughput, for testing. Creative only.
items.Pipe_Debug_Fluid.name=Debug Fluid Pipe
items.Pipe_Debug_Fluid.description=Unlimited fluid throughput, for testing. Creative only.
items.Pipe_Debug_Gas.name=Debug Gas Pipe
items.Pipe_Debug_Gas.description=Unlimited gas throughput, for testing. Creative only.
items.Pipe_Debug_Heat.name=Debug Heat Pipe
items.Pipe_Debug_Heat.description=Unlimited heat throughput, for testing. Creative only.
